      <h2>Site publisher</h2>
      <p>
        WEBLACK AFRICA<br />
        Company with a share capital of €100,000<br />
        Registered office: Paris, France
      </p>
      <p>
        Phone: <a href="tel:+330743700063">+33 07 43 70 00 63</a><br />
        Email: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        Publication director:<br />
        Deo-Gratias Kpodo, Founder &amp; Creative Director
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>This site is hosted by:</p>
      <p>
        HOSTINGER INTERNATIONAL LIMITED<br />
        61 Lordou Vironos Street<br />
